{%- comment -%}
  owv2-subscribe — OWV2 Subscription spot.
  Layout/spacing follows the "COMPONENT - Subscription Builder" design file
  (Omawild Web Redesign handoff). Two deliberate deviations from that file:
  - Fonts stay var(--font-heading-family)/var(--font-body-family) (NHD) —
    the file's Figtree/Archivo stack is not this theme's typography; see
    CLAUDE.md's Typography section. Weights map to NHD's real 400/600/700/900
    (the file's 500 → 400, 800 → 900) rather than synthesizing an unshipped
    weight, the exact trap CLAUDE.md already flags for this codebase.
  - Prices are computed from real Shopify data (see below), not the design
    file's flat 10%-off placeholder formula.

  Data source
  - Roasts are NOT typed in by the merchant. They are every product in
    `section.settings.collection` that has at least one selling plan
    (product.selling_plan_groups.size > 0) — add or remove a product from
    that collection and this section updates on its own, no theme-editor
    edits needed. This mirrors sections/owv2-product-main.liquid's rule:
    subscription data always comes from the product, never typed twice.
  - Step 01 (roast) can render as text pills or as image cards —
    section.settings.roast_display — matching the design file's per-page
    "step1" prop (pills on the homepage, cards on the Subscriptions page).
    It's a merchant/build-time choice, not something a shopper toggles, so
    it's plain Liquid branching with no JS involved. Only step 01 has a card
    mode; steps 02/03 are always pills, same as the design file.
  - Step 02 (quantity) is that roast's weight/size option, matched by NAME
    (an option whose name contains "weight" or "size", e.g. this store's
    "Net Weight" — falling back to the last option if none match), deduped
    to one pill per distinct value. Matching by name rather than position
    matters here: this store's products put "Type" (Whole Bean / Ground for
    espresso) first and "Net Weight" second, so a positional first-option
    read pulled the coffee form instead of the bag size. A roast with a
    third option has that axis ignored, same simplification owv2-product-main
    does not need to make since it only ever shows one product at a time.
  - Step 03 (frequency) is that roast's own product.selling_plan_groups,
    flattened across groups exactly like owv2-product-main's plan pills.
    Two roasts can offer different frequencies; switching roasts rebuilds
    steps 02 and 03 from scratch.
  - Only step 01 (the roast list) is known at render time, so it's the only
    step Liquid renders. Steps 02/03 and the summary are empty shells filled
    in by assets/owv2-subscribe.js from the embedded JSON, same
    render-after-connect approach the previous static version already used.
  - The CTA is a real /cart/add form (id + selling_plan), not a link —
    same pattern as owv2-product-main's form, hand-written here since a
    single form must be able to submit any of several products rather than
    one `{% form 'product', product %}`-bound product.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% assign owid = section.id | replace: '-', '' | replace: '_', '' %}
{% style %}
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  --bg: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
  --ink: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
  --surface: {{ section.settings.card_background }};
  --midnight: #00180C;
  --sunbrella: #FBB925;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  padding: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px) {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  font-family: var(--font-body-family);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} *, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} *::before, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} h1, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} h2, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
  color: inherit;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -.035em;
  line-height: 1.05;
  text-transform: none;
  margin: 0;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} p {
  margin: 0;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} a {
  color: inherit;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} img, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} svg {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} :focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid currentColor;
  outline-offset: 4px;
  }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} * {
  scroll-behavior: auto !important;
  scroll-snap-type: none !important;
  }
}

{%- comment -%} Grid: left column (intro + steps) + summary. Same grid
  whether or not JS has upgraded owv2-subscribe yet, and reused for the
  no-eligible-roasts fallback via .grid-empty so both stay pixel-aligned. {%- endcomment -%}
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} owv2-subscribe, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .grid-empty {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(320px,400px);
  gap: 48px 72px;
  align-items: start;
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin-inline: auto;
  min-width: 0;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .left {
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .pill {
  display: inline-block;
  align-self: flex-start;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--bg);
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font: 900 10.5px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  letter-spacing: .12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .left h2 {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 46px);
  max-width: 19ch;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .body-copy {
  margin-top: 20px;
  max-width: 46ch;
  font: 400 14.5px/1.65 var(--font-body-family);
  color: var(--midnight);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .steps {
  margin-top: {% if section.settings.roast_display == 'cards' %}28{% else %}44{% endif %}px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} fieldset.step {
  border: 0;
  border-top: 1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 25%, transparent);
  margin: 0;
  padding: 26px 0;
  min-width: 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 26px minmax(0,1fr);
  column-gap: 20px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} fieldset.step--last {
  padding-bottom: 0;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .step__num {
  grid-column: 1;
  grid-row: 1;
  font: 900 13px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  color: var(--ink);
  }
{%- comment -%}
  legend stays in the DOM as the fieldset's accessible name but is visually
  hidden -- a real <legend> keeps browsers' special border-straddling
  placement even inside a grid fieldset (it rendered the step's border
  through the middle of the label text). The visible label is the plain
  .step__label div instead, same as the design file's plain divs.
{%- endcomment -%}
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} fieldset.step legend {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .step__label {
  grid-column: 2;
  grid-row: 1;
  display: block;
  font: 900 11px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  letter-spacing: .14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} fieldset.step .options {
  grid-column: 2;
  grid-row: 2;
  margin-top: 16px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .options {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option {
  position: relative;
  cursor: pointer;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option input {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  opacity: 0;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option span {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 11px 15px;
  background: var(--surface);
  font: 700 12px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option:hover span,
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option input:checked + span {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--bg);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option input:focus-visible + span {
  outline: 3px solid var(--ink);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .option.is-unavailable span {
  text-decoration: line-through;
  opacity: .55;
  }

{%- comment -%} Step 01 card mode — image + name + note, used on pages like
  Subscriptions where roasts need more than a label to tell apart. {%- endcomment -%}
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .options--cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 240px), 1fr));
  gap: 10px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card {
  position: relative;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: block;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card input {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  opacity: 0;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card__face {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 10px 14px 10px 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--ink);
  transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card:hover .roast-card__face,
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card input:checked + .roast-card__face {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--bg);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card input:focus-visible + .roast-card__face {
  outline: 3px solid var(--ink);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card__img {
  flex: none;
  width: 76px;
  height: 76px;
  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  object-fit: cover;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--sunbrella);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card__body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 5px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card__name {
  font: 900 16px/1.1 var(--font-heading-family);
  letter-spacing: -.01em;
  color: inherit;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card__note {
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
  overflow: hidden;
  font: 400 12.5px/1.4 var(--font-body-family);
  color: var(--midnight);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .roast-card input:checked + .roast-card__face .roast-card__note {
  color: inherit;
  }

.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .summary {
  min-width: 0;
  position: sticky;
  top: {{ section.settings.summary_offset | default: 110 }}px;
  align-self: start;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 32px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .summary .eyebrow {
  font: 900 10.5px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  letter-spacing: .14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .summary h3 {
  margin-top: 22px;
  font-size: 28px;
  letter-spacing: -.025em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .summary [data-description] {
  margin-top: 10px;
  font: 400 13.5px/1.5 var(--font-body-family);
  color: var(--midnight);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .prices {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 28px;
  padding-top: 26px;
  border-top: 1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 25%, transparent);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .prices strong {
  font: 900 38px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  letter-spacing: -.03em;
  color: var(--ink);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .prices s {
  font: 600 14px/1 var(--font-body-family);
  color: var(--midnight);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .saving {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 12px;
  background: var(--sunbrella);
  color: var(--midnight);
  font: 900 12px/1.2 var(--font-heading-family);
  padding: 7px 11px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .summary form {
  margin-top: 28px;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .owv2-button {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 16px 0;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--bg);
  font: 900 13px/1 var(--font-heading-family);
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: filter .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .owv2-button:hover {
  filter: brightness(.85);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .owv2-button:disabled {
  cursor: not-allowed;
  opacity: .55;
  filter: none;
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .shipping {
  margin-top: 16px;
  font: 400 12.5px/1.55 var(--font-body-family);
  color: var(--midnight);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .empty-note {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font: 400 14.5px/1.65 var(--font-body-family);
  color: var(--midnight);
  }
@media (max-width: 1023px) {
  .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} owv2-subscribe, .owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .grid-empty {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr);
  }
.owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }} .summary {
  position: static;
  }
}
{% endstyle %}

{%- liquid
  assign product_limit = section.settings.product_limit | default: 12
  assign roast_total = 0
  for p in section.settings.collection.products
    if roast_total >= product_limit
      break
    endif
    if p.selling_plan_groups.size > 0
      assign roast_total = roast_total | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
  assign has_roasts = false
  if roast_total > 0
    assign has_roasts = true
  endif
  assign is_cards = false
  if section.settings.roast_display == 'cards'
    assign is_cards = true
  endif
-%}

<div class="owv2-subscribe-{{ owid }}">
{%- if has_roasts -%}
<owv2-subscribe
  data-owv2-id="{{ section.id }}"
  data-currency="{{ cart.currency.iso_code | default: shop.currency | escape }}"
  data-locale="{{ request.locale.iso_code | escape }}"
  data-savings="{{ section.settings.savings_template | escape }}"
  data-cta="{{ section.settings.cta_label | escape }}"
  data-sold-out="{{ section.settings.cta_sold_out_label | escape }}"
>
<div class="left">
<span class="pill">{{ section.settings.badge_text | escape }}</span>
<h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
<div class="body-copy">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
<div class="steps">
<fieldset class="step">
<div class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
<legend>{{ section.settings.step1_label | escape }}</legend>
<div class="step__label">{{ section.settings.step1_label | escape }}</div>
<div class="options{% if is_cards %} options--cards{% endif %}">
{%- assign roast_index = 0 -%}
{%- for roast in section.settings.collection.products -%}
  {%- if roast_index >= product_limit -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if roast.selling_plan_groups.size == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign roast_index = roast_index | plus: 1 -%}
  {%- if is_cards -%}
<label class="roast-card">
<input type="radio" name="owv2-roast-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ roast.id }}" data-owv2-roast {% if roast_index == 1 %}checked{% endif %}>
<span class="roast-card__face">
{%- if roast.featured_image -%}
{{ roast.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: roast.featured_image.alt | default: roast.title, class: 'roast-card__img' }}
{%- else -%}
<span class="roast-card__img" aria-hidden="true"></span>
{%- endif -%}
<span class="roast-card__body">
<span class="roast-card__name">{{ roast.title }}</span>
{%- if roast.metafields.custom.product_caption != blank -%}<span class="roast-card__note">{{ roast.metafields.custom.product_caption.value }}</span>{%- endif -%}
</span>
</span>
</label>
  {%- else -%}
<label class="option">
<input type="radio" name="owv2-roast-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ roast.id }}" data-owv2-roast {% if roast_index == 1 %}checked{% endif %}>
<span>{{ roast.title }}</span>
</label>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
</div>
</fieldset>
<fieldset class="step">
<div class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
<legend>{{ section.settings.step2_label | escape }}</legend>
<div class="step__label">{{ section.settings.step2_label | escape }}</div>
<div class="options" data-owv2-sizes></div>
</fieldset>
<fieldset class="step step--last">
<div class="step__num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
<legend>{{ section.settings.step3_label | escape }}</legend>
<div class="step__label">{{ section.settings.step3_label | escape }}</div>
<div class="options" data-owv2-plans></div>
</fieldset>
</div>
</div>
<aside class="summary">
<p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.summary_title | escape }}</p>
<div aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
<h3 data-roast>
</h3>
<p data-description>{{ section.settings.empty_message | escape }}</p>
<p class="prices" hidden>
<strong data-total>
</strong> <s data-original>
</s>
</p>
<p class="saving" data-saving>
</p>
</div>
<form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-owv2-form>
<input type="hidden" name="id" value="" data-owv2-variant>
<input type="hidden" name="selling_plan" value="" data-owv2-plan>
<input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
<button type="submit" name="add" class="owv2-button" data-owv2-cta disabled>{{ section.settings.cta_label | escape }}</button>
</form>
<p class="shipping">{{ section.settings.shipping_note | escape }}</p>
</aside>

<script type="application/json" data-owv2-subscribe-json>
{
  "moneyFormat": {{ shop.money_format | json }},
  "products": [
    {%- assign json_index = 0 -%}
    {%- for roast in section.settings.collection.products -%}
      {%- if json_index >= product_limit -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if roast.selling_plan_groups.size == 0 -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign json_index = json_index | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        The quantity step must key off the SIZE/WEIGHT option, not whichever
        option happens to sit first -- this store's products put "Type"
        (Whole Bean / Ground for espresso) at position 1 and "Net Weight" at
        position 2, so a positional .first pulled the coffee form instead of
        the bag size. Match by name instead, falling back to the last option
        (weight/size is the last axis on every roast we've seen) only if no
        option name mentions weight or size at all.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign size_option_index = -1 -%}
      {%- for o in roast.options -%}
        {%- assign o_name_down = o.name | downcase -%}
        {%- if o_name_down contains 'weight' or o_name_down contains 'size' -%}
          {%- assign size_option_index = forloop.index0 -%}
          {%- break -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if size_option_index == -1 -%}
        {%- assign size_option_index = roast.options.size | minus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- assign size_option = roast.options[size_option_index] -%}
      {
        "id": {{ roast.id | json }},
        "title": {{ roast.title | json }},
        "optionName": {{ size_option.name | json }},
        "variants": [
          {%- for v in roast.variants -%}
            {
              "id": {{ v.id }},
              "value": {{ v.options[size_option_index] | json }},
              "available": {{ v.available | json }},
              "price": {{ v.price }},
              "compare": {{ v.compare_at_price | default: 0 }},
              "plans": {
                {%- for alloc in v.selling_plan_allocations -%}
                  "{{ alloc.selling_plan.id }}": {{ alloc.price }}{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
                {%- endfor -%}
              }
            }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        ],
        "sellingPlans": [
          {%- assign total_plans = 0 -%}
          {%- for group in roast.selling_plan_groups -%}
            {%- assign total_plans = total_plans | plus: group.selling_plans.size -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- assign plan_index = 0 -%}
          {%- for group in roast.selling_plan_groups -%}
            {%- for plan in group.selling_plans -%}
              {%- assign plan_index = plan_index | plus: 1 -%}
              { "id": {{ plan.id | json }}, "name": {{ plan.name | json }} }{% unless plan_index == total_plans %},{% endunless %}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        ]
      }{% unless json_index == roast_total %},{% endunless %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ]
}
</script>
</owv2-subscribe>
<script src="{{ 'owv2-subscribe.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer">
</script>
{%- else -%}
<div class="grid-empty">
<div class="left">
<span class="pill">{{ section.settings.badge_text | escape }}</span>
<h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
<div class="body-copy">{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
<p class="empty-note">{{ section.settings.empty_message | escape }}</p>
</div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "OWV2 Subscription spot",
  "tag": "section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": [
      "header",
      "footer"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "badge_text",
      "label": "Badge text",
      "default": "SUBSCRIBE & SAVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Keep the ritual going and never run low on energy"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "<p>Fresh roast on your schedule. Save on every delivery. And each subscription helps us do more for you and our planet. Skip, swap or cancel any time.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Roasts"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Subscribable coffees",
